          <tr><th scope="row">Owner-managed service, like AccountOrbit</th><td>Coordinated by the owner; reserved work by someone qualified for it</td><td>You want one person to talk to who helps work out what you need</td><td>Who does and signs each part, and the full fee, in writing</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Accounting or CA firm directly</th><td>That firm</td><td>You already know who you want</td><td>Credentials, who actually handles your file, and scope</td></tr>
